<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani interbank rates steady in tight market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani interbank rates steady in tight market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's interbank money market rates remained unchanged on Thursday because of a liquidity shortage, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;There was no change in interbank overnight rates,&quot; a dealer at KASB &amp; Co said.</p>
<p>Trading was conducted at 20 percent and the market showed signs of being short yet again, the dealer said.</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
